"links ([?](#why-have-rationale-sections)) will be present which link to the "
"relevant \"Rationale and alternatives\" section to justify a decision or "
"provide alternatives to it."
msgstr ""

#: src/3873-build-std-context.md:102
msgid ""
"Additionally, \"note alerts\" will be used in the _Proposal_ sections to "
"separate implementation considerations from the core proposal. "
"Implementation details should be considered non-normative. These details "
